            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.51.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEC.14.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zek 14:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Reeba, niinyija kuhindura Yerusaalemu ekikopo ky'okugwereranisa amahanga goona agagyehinguririize, kandi kigwereranise na Yuda, Yerusaalemu yaaba neegotwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEC.14.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zek 14:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.21.44"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 21:44",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Eryo izooba Yerusaalemu egyo ndyagihindura eibaare eririkurema amahanga goona; abaririkiriza boona baryashaasha munonga. Amahanga goona ag'omu nsi garyayeteerana kugirwanisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.28.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bir 28:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.76.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 76:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " MUKAMA naagira ati: Ndyaitsa buri mbaraasi yoona obwoba, n'ogitembire weena mmugwise eiraro. Kwonka enju ya Yuda ndyagigumyaho amaisho, kandi embaraasi z'amahanga zoona ndyazihumya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima enganda za Yuda ziryagira omu mitima yaazo ziti: Abatuuzi ba Yerusaalemu baine amaani agu barikuheebwa MUKAMA ow'amahe Ruhanga waabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
