        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi ndyashuka aha nju ya Daudi n'aha batwire Yerusaalemu omwoyo gw'embabazi n'okweshengyereza; ku barireeba ou baacumitsire, baryamucurira, nk'omwe nyamunegyere, bamuririre munonga, nk'oku omuntu aririra omwana we w'omujigaijo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
